Krita Nova 68 - Material Symbols for the near matches too

- The icons that Material Symbols has only a near match for are replaced by
  that symbol as well (the "Approximate" rows of the mapping sheet: magic
  wand, invert selection, ungroup, merge down, split layer, line tool,
  Bezier path, multibrush, linear interpolation, curves, opacity up/down,
  brush option sliders, group shapes, ...), as patch 67 did for the exact
  matches.

